<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Holiday returns five weeks after starting buprenorphine, after a three-week tour. She has taken 16 mg every morning without a gap and has used no heroin or other opioids. Cravings are now brief and come mostly late at night after a show; she calls her peer recovery coach when they do. She takes acamprosate most days but sometimes forgets the midday dose. She has cut down to two or three drinks on performance nights. She spoke with her counselor by phone each week while away. Her mood is a little better. She kept the naloxone in her bag and has not needed it. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Buprenorphine</td><td>16 mg daily, no gaps</td></tr><tr><td>Opioid use</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Cravings</td><td>Brief, late at night; she calls her peer coach</td></tr><tr><td>Alcohol</td><td>Two or three drinks on performance nights</td></tr><tr><td>Acamprosate</td><td>Most days; misses some midday doses</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

